- How would you adjust MAX to prevent starvation without starving CPU-bound threads?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests the ability to design scalable I/O budgeting, cross-CPU coordination, and NUMA-aware fairness under heavy multi-tenant workloads.

## Key Concepts

